Optional REBOUND extra

The optional "rebound" extra imports REBOUND when that package is installed.
OrbitWeaver does not vendor REBOUND source. REBOUND is an optional runtime
dependency, used only for an IAS15 comparison
(src/orbitweaver/rebound_check.py). The Keplerian core runs without it.

